translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_2d3d847d:

    # "The werewolf charges at Tetto, trying to push him on the ground, but he leaps away in time."
    "狼人冲向泰托，想把他撞倒；但泰托及时跳开。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_9519dcb5:

    # ww "Heh... little prey. Give up now and maybe we'll give you and your friends a quick death."
    ww "呵……小猎物，现在认输吧。也许我们会让你和你的朋友痛快地死去。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_849beb2b:

    # ww "Tetto, we knew you're one of the weaklings, but we didn't expect such cowardice in you."
    ww "泰托，我们早知道你是个废物，却没想到你会这么懦弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_7365540a:

    # ww "I'm almost done with you, little prey. Uffe will be elated to see your demise."
    ww "我快把你解决了，小猎物。乌菲一定会很高兴看到你死掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_b7faf2ef:

    # ww "It's time, my friend, you know we can't let you escape, so why not make this quick?"
    ww "到时候了，朋友。你知道我们不能放你们逃走，那就让一切快点结束吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_078a90eb:

    # "The werewolf swings his claw at you, scraping against your side. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "狼人的爪子扫过你的身体，在你的肋侧划出一道伤口。你的生命值减少了[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_e1d1f7bb:

    # "The werewolf swings his claw at Tetto, scraping against his side. His health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "狼人的爪子扫过泰托的身体，在他的肋侧划出一道伤口。泰托的生命值减少了[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_88f0fa84:

    # "Your bleeding has gotten worse from the werewolf."
    "你的伤口流血得更厉害了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_3034cbd4:

    # "Tetto is bleeding much worse now."
    "泰托的伤口流血得更厉害了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_23ba5b86:

    # "You begin to bleed from your wound as the werewolf watches in jeer."
    "你开始从伤口流血，狼人幸灾乐祸地看着。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_battle_loop_9ba2c9c7:

    # "Tetto begins to bleed from the newly-formed wound clawed by the werewolf."
    "泰托被狼人抓出的新伤口开始流血。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_b7d13101:

    # "You pant heavily as both werewolves falls on the ground."
    "两只狼人都倒在地上，你大口喘着气。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_2682f183:

    # "Without hesitation, you turn around to leave, only to see Tetto still staring at the werewolves."
    "你毫不犹豫地转身准备离开，却发现泰托仍盯着那两只狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_2fbd37a6:

    # ww "F-fuck. Uffe is going to kill us for letting you two go."
    ww "操、操……乌菲会因为我们放你们两个离开而杀了我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_bb29d3db:

    # ww2 "Ugh..."
    ww2 "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_5aadbdd3:

    # tt "You can leave with us, escape the forest. Uffe can't reach you outside."
    tt "你们可以和我们一起离开，逃出森林。乌菲管不到外面。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_a92be1d8:

    # "You are quite honestly stunned by how quickly Tetto invites them to tag along, considering 10 seconds ago you were fighting to death."
    "泰托这么快就邀请他们同行，让你着实惊讶——十秒前你们还在拼死战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_230f111c:

    # "The two defeated werewolves look at each other."
    "两只战败的狼人面面相觑。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_5e44a316:

    # "Without another words, they staggers away from you two, towards the path you two took."
    "他们没有再说什么，便朝你们来时的路踉跄离去。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_cce190d1:

    # "It's clear the decision they've made was grim, but understandable."
    "显然，他们做出的决定很沉重，却也合情合理。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_a9d36594:

    # ww2 "We didn't see anything."
    ww2 "我们什么都没看见。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_d81c263e:

    # "As they walk, the two turns to you and Tetto as they support each other's weights."
    "他们互相搀扶着向前走，途中回头看向你和泰托。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_6307dd3a:

    # "They slightly nods at you, eyes with a sorrowful look, before slowly disappearing into the mist."
    "他们带着悲伤的目光向你微微点头，然后慢慢消失在雾中。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_8104fd8b:

    # tt "Shall we continue? It's almost there."
    tt "我们继续走吗？快到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_3c582672:

    # "The maned werewolf picks up his brother, who's still in deep slumber."
    "鬃毛狼抱起仍在沉睡的弟弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_71ff470d:

    # "His step falters, but he manages to keep his balance despite the wounds and injuries."
    "尽管遍体鳞伤，他脚步踉跄，却仍设法保持平衡。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_861b13e4:

    # tt "Say, [e]. You need to recommend me that lizard of yours, he's got a good recipe for an ointment, right?"
    tt "对了，[e]。你得把你认识的那只蜥蜴推荐给我。他有很好的药膏配方，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_3bc1b836:

    # e "Yeah, I think so."
    e "嗯，我想是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_b022e1a0:

    # tt "Good, I can use a whole jar right now."
    tt "太好了，我现在就能用掉整整一罐。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_d43a60eb:

    # "Tetto smiles."
    "泰托笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_00fa044f:

    # "It's clear Tetto has less of a mood to talk right now, considering what has panned out in the fight."
    "考虑到这场战斗的结果，泰托显然已经没什么心情说话了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_49147c8e:

    # "And you decide to stay quiet as well, just to let your thought sinks in."
    "你也决定保持安静，让思绪慢慢沉淀。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_b6c6f86e:

    # tt "What do you think the outside world has for us? Will it be good? Or the same."
    tt "你觉得外面的世界会给我们什么？会是美好的，还是一如既往？"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_0d2189b4:

    # "After a while, the werewolf speaks once more."
    "过了一会儿，狼人再次开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_a39befb0:

    # e "I believe you will meet so much more people outside, there will be bad things within, but you'll also discover something good, something worthwhile."
    e "我相信你们会在外面遇到更多人。那里也会有糟糕的事，但你们同样会发现美好、值得珍惜的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_c710e707:

    # tt "Good is good enough."
    tt "好就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_36ed6e52:

    # "Tetto takes another step, before he comes to a halt."
    "泰托又迈出一步，随后停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_340707dd:

    # e "We're out of the forest now."
    e "我们已经走出森林了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_2366ac62:

    # "You look around, hearing the splurging sound of water, you three seem to be near the cascades now."
    "你环顾四周，听见水流奔涌的声音。看来你们三个已经来到瀑布附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_9acd25b7:

    # tt "Oh my- Everything is so bright here."
    tt "天啊……这里的一切都好亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_8c4b00f0:

    # e "Yeah!"
    e "嗯！"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_ea7cc79e:

    # "Tetto walks around in awe as he lays down his sleeping brother."
    "泰托惊叹地环顾四周，然后把熟睡的弟弟放下。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_50044e74:

    # e "You sure you two are fine here? There are still monsters around, even though they're not as vicious as your people."
    e "你们两个确定要待在这里吗？附近仍有怪物，虽然它们没有你们族人那么凶猛。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_ada75c9e:

    # tt "Well, we're werewolves too!"
    tt "我们也是狼人啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_57624fd4:

    # "He chides loudly, with a friendly smile."
    "他带着友善的笑容大声反驳。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_3aa2280f:

    # tt "Rumma is almost awake here, we'll be okay."
    tt "鲁玛差不多要醒了，我们不会有事的。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_a38549b4:

    # tt "However, we still want to get away as far as possible from Uffe, for now."
    tt "不过现在，我们还是想尽可能离乌菲远一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_bd7d5d0c:

    # "The werewolf grins."
    "狼人咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_f9637a5b:

    # e "I'm so glad to be able to help you."
    e "我很高兴能帮到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_88a34193:

    # "He turns to you, this time with a warm glance."
    "他转过身来，目光温和地落在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_e6b7e0fb:

    # tt "And I'm glad you turned around, from Uffe."
    tt "我也很高兴你没有听从乌菲的命令。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_b3c85c27:

    # tt "I just deduced that you had some tasks given by the alpha, from how those two in the forest spoke."
    tt "从那两个家伙在森林里说的话来看，我猜到你接了头狼交代的任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_9d4f9d3d:

    # tt "But regardless, you defied his order just to help strangers like us. That just makes me admire you more, little friend."
    tt "可你还是违抗了他的命令，只为了帮助我们这样的陌生人。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_134459a3:

    # "Tetto gives you a warm embrace, covering you easily in his red brown fur."
    "泰托给了你一个温暖的拥抱，红棕色的毛皮轻易将你包裹其中。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_3ba0ca2b:

    # "You don't know how to respond, you felt as if you've betrayed Tetto's trust, but somehow, he's grown to like you more."
    "你不知道该如何回应。你觉得自己仿佛辜负了泰托的信任，可不知不觉间，他似乎反而更喜欢你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_5132cd11:

    # tt "You helped treat Rumma's wound, and you escaped with us. That'll spell you a lot of troubles from Uffe."
    tt "你帮忙治好了鲁玛的伤口，还和我们一起逃了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_dd6039c0:

    # tt "Don't ever get near the den, and remember to conceal your smell around if you decide to go back."
    tt "别再靠近狼穴了。要是你决定回去，记得藏好自己的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_cf3278c6:

    # e "Actually, I've had help from Wuldon, he's just like you two, very good at hiding."
    e "其实我得到过沃顿的帮助。他和你们一样，都很擅长隐藏行踪。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_99c0e108:

    # tt "W-wuldon? The herbalist's son?"
    tt "沃、沃顿？那个草药师的儿子？"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_2b40a022_1:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_6b21d205:

    # tt "I've seen that big blue werewolf before, but it's been so long."
    tt "我以前见过那只高大的蓝色狼人，但已经是很久以前了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_4b28a0e5:

    # tt "What is he up to?"
    tt "他最近在做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_1e99e1af:

    # e "Well, a few things. Maybe after everything, you'll be able to return to the forest whenever you'd like."
    e "等一切结束后，也许你们就能随时回到森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_244a32e9:

    # tt "Hah, well, don't get my hopes up like that."
    tt "哈，别把我的希望吊得这么高。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_16c96458:

    # e "I- I know."
    e "我、我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_142775fd:

    # tt "Well, I've seen a big blue werewolf carrying water around the split trails, perhaps you should go visit him sometimes."
    tt "我见过一只高大的蓝色狼人，带着水在岔路附近走动。你或许该找时间去拜访他。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_c72ef864:

    # e "I think I know him, we talked quite a lot about the pack's history."
    e "我想我认识他。我们聊过不少狼群的历史。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_cb23f038:

    # tt "That's great, he was the herbalist's son, actually. So I suppose he can get you around the forest easily."
    tt "他其实是草药师的儿子。这样看来，他能很轻松地带你在森林里来去。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_41ff77b5:

    # e "Where can I find him?"
    e "我在哪儿能找到他？"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_f7e4afbb:

    # tt "Through some sort of riddle in the split trails, I think he definitely has his genius method of concealing his location, unlike us."
    tt "得解开岔路上的某个谜题。我想他肯定有自己高明的藏身办法，不像我们这么容易被找到。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_d43a60eb_1:

    # "Tetto smiles."
    "泰托笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_4ddba342:

    # tt "Oh, and speaking of the herbalist, there's something that I want to give you."
    tt "哦，说到草药师，我有件东西想送给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_b99fa1dc:

    # "The werewolf takes out a pair of old gloves, and put them on your hand."
    "狼人取出一双旧手套，替你戴上。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_a252d62e:

    # tt "Here, it was the herbalist's gloves, he gave it to me the last time I saw him. It should help you pick up some herbs very easily."
    tt "给，这是草药师的手套。他上次见我时交给我的。戴着它，你采集草药会方便很多。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_f1758625:

    # e "Thank you, Tetto."
    e "谢谢你，泰托。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_47c16d24:

    # tt "Anyway, my brother is still sleeping like a baby now. His wound's recovered, I should make a bed around here soon."
    tt "我弟弟还睡得像个婴儿。他的伤已经恢复了，我很快就该在这附近给他搭张床。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_6a571956:

    # e "I guess we'll split here."
    e "看来我们就此分别了。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_5ac1a863:

    # tt "Yep. May we meet again, [e]."
    tt "嗯。希望我们还能再见，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_5f051950:

    # e "Take care, Tetto."
    e "保重，泰托。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_win_06a2d283:

    # "Tetto raises his hand to wave you goodbye as you leave."
    "泰托举手向你道别，你转身离去。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_a1996fa6:

    # "The werewolves jeer, instead of the usual banters, you see actual bloodlust in their eyes."
    "狼人发出嘲弄的笑声。不同于平时的戏弄，你从他们眼中看到了真正的杀意。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_30067e19:

    # "And soon you realise, it's the end of the journey."
    "很快，你意识到这段旅程走到了尽头。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_50fe2d47:

    # "Without another second thought, the werewolf in front of you swings his claws one last time, hitting across your face."
    "你甚至来不及多想，面前的狼人最后一次挥动利爪，狠狠划过你的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_55aed3f3:

    # "He doesn't spare any energy left, just letting his claws bury inside your head for just the mere tenth of a seconds it collides."
    "他没有保留半分力气，利爪在碰撞的短短十分之一秒里便刺入你的头颅。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_685e948d:

    # "It was quicker than you thought, perhaps it was his unique method of showing mercy, your vision goes dark immediately."
    "速度比你想象的更快。或许那是他独特的仁慈方式——你的视野立刻陷入黑暗。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_6cf48d8f:

    # "You can hear Tetto gasps surprisingly as your body goes limp, and you slump on the ground hard, before he's taken away by the two werewolves."
    "你的身体瘫软，重重倒地；你听见泰托惊讶地倒吸一口气，随后两个狼人把他拖走。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_49d7d7a8:

    # tt "G-get off me! You monsters."
    tt "放开我！你们这些怪物！"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_41871384:

    # "The sound of Tetto being dragged away are faintly heard, but the majority of the senses goes to the pain from your crushed head."
    "你隐约听见泰托被拖走的声音，但大脑几乎只剩下被砸碎的头颅传来的剧痛。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_5846ad61:

    # "Soon, you hear his brother is dragged away as well, leaving you alone on the forest floor."
    "很快，你听见他的弟弟也被拖走，只留下你独自躺在森林地面上。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_tetto_lose_1cd7638a:

    # "You take your last breath before everything comes to a halt."
    "你吐出最后一口气，一切都归于停滞。"
